        "text_Qfyb4K": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We designed this statement entrance into a telecoms head office with a high-tech, modern design style in mind. The focal point is the statement custom island, with an integrated central planter to incorporate some biophilic elements amongst a very slick palette of cool wood tones, matt black, nickel and brushed chrome. Pops of red inspired by the brand logo are added in measured proportions on the magazine display, bespoke shelving and in some upholstered items. The challenge was to create a multifuctional space for both staff and clients that is memorable and represented the brand.</p>",
