            "text": "<p>༶ Custom joinery design with central planter, hidden fridge and seating</p><p>༶ Custom angular seating design with upholstered seat pads</p><p>༶ Bespoke backlit branding and signage</p><p>༶ Branding integration using pops of colour and curated material palette</p>",
